LSON: Oh man, the bragging promo. Sorry about that.\par \par \uc2 We had a great time tonight. We'll be back tomorrow hope. You'll join us then. By the way, a brand new episode of "Tucker Carlson Today" featuring Jason Whitlock, his life story. Worth watching.\par \par \uc2 And of course, we'll be back every night at 8:00 PM, the show that is the sworn enemy of lying, pomposity, smugness, and groupthink.\par \par \uc2 Ladies and gentlemen, the Great Sean Hannity.\par \par \uc2 SEAN HANNITY, FOX NEWS CHANNEL HOST: By the way, it is not bragging. It's just telling the truth. Telling you a story.\par \par \uc2 I'm in favor of being honest. Let's take it as it is.\par \par \uc2 CARLSON: Thank you.\par \par \uc2 HANNITY: I'm cool with that. You don't need to apologize for that commercial. That's awesome.\par \par \uc2 Anyway, Tucker, thank you.\par \par \uc2 CARLSON: Thank you.\par \par \uc2 END\par \par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2022 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2022 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All  materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not  be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast  without the prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You  may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from  copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 Document TCARL00020220201ei1v00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Thousands Mourn Slain NYPD Officer Jason Rivera; Several Officers Across U.S. Shot In Past 48 Hours; Rep. Michael Waltz (R-FL), Is Being Interviewed About 8,500 troops from Fort Bragg and Fort Campbell that have not been deployed as of this hour; Biden Talks About Jobs, Economy In Battleground Pennsylvania; White House Responds To Video Of "Secret" Migrant Flights\b0\par\par\uc2 Trace Gallagher, Pete Hegseth, Joe Concha, Will Nunley, Mark  Meredith, Peter Doocy, Ari Fleischer, Sean Duffy, Lisa Boothe \par \uc2 8,800 \u