n't existed before. We have deep and valuable insights into life itself.\par \par \uc2 Human beings do remarkable variety of legitimately interesting things. Talking about corona is not one of them. So let's stop.\par \par \uc2 One of the goals of the BLM movement from day one has been eliminating the nuclear family. A new effort is underway to fight back and protect the family. Thank God. That's straight ahead.\par \par \uc2 (COMMERCIAL BREAK)\par \par \uc2 KEVIN CORKE, FOX NEWS CHANNEL WHITE HOUSE CORRESPONDENT: Welcome to "FOX News Live." I'm Kevin Corke.\par \par \uc2 New Mexico authorities issuing a search warrant for actor Alec Baldwin's cell phone. They say the phone could hold evidence that might be helpful as they investigate the deadly shooting on the film set of "Rust."\par \par \uc2 Baldwin, you'll recall was holding the revolver during rehearsals when it fired, killing the cinematographer and wounding the director. Baldwin has maintained he did not pull the trigger. So far no charges have been filed.\par \par \uc2 The Biden administration reportedly ending settlement talks with migrant families separated at the border, and agreement could have led to a billion dollars in payments to families separated in 2018 under the Trump administration's zero tolerance immigration policy.\par \par \uc2 Talks stalled after a leak in late October suggested that parents affected could be paid up to $450,000.00.\par \par \uc2 That's going to do it for this update. I'm Kevin Corke. Now back to more TUCKER CARLSON TONIGHT.\par \par \uc2 CARLSON: On its website, they're not hiding it. BLM has called for the elimination of the nuclear family and they are not the only ones. This is a big theme on the left.\par \par \uc2 Children are a burden to the environment. Don't be loyal to your family.\par \par \uc2 A Rutgers professor called Brittney Cooper just came right out and said it. Here's what she said, quote: "We don't need traditional nuclear families for black thriving."\pa