ll day. Methinks that you're at buyer, but, I mean, we will see.\par \par \uc2 Ashley, you're the best. Thank you very much.\par \par \uc2 By the way, this is just the wave now, real estate and the fascination with it. And beginning next week on FOX Business, we have got some darned great shows just exploring all facets of it.\par \par \uc2 The "American Dream Home" with \uc2 Cheryl Casone\uc2  starts next Tuesday at 8:00 p.m., "Mansion Global" with Kacie McDonnell 9:00 p.m.\par \par \uc2 This is all the rage. A lot of people aren't keen on stocks, but, man, oh, man, they love real estate. I don't know if they are keen on buying Shaq's home, but a lot of homes.\par \par \uc2 Here comes "The Five."\par \par \uc2 THIS IS A RUSH TRANSCRIPT. THIS COPY MAY NOT BE IN ITS FINAL FORM AND MAY BE UPDATED.\par \par \uc2 END\par \par \uc2 Content and Programming Copyright 2021 Fox News Network, LLC. ALL  RIGHTS RESERVED. Copyright 2021 VIQ Media Transcription, Inc.  All  materials herein are protected by United States copyright law and may not  be reproduced, distributed, transmitted, displayed, published or broadcast  without the prior written permission of VIQ Media Transcription, Inc. You  may not alter or remove any trademark, copyright or other notice from  copies of the content. \par \par \uc2 Document CAVU000020210915eh9f00001\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 News; Domestic\par \b \uc2 Biden's New Ethos: Enemies Over Americans; Biden Crushes Freedom To Distract From Failures; Dems Inventing Invisible Threats; NY Times: U.S. Drone Strike Hit U.S. Affiliated Aid Worker, Not ISIS-K Facilitator; Interview with Former White House Press Secretary Ari Fleischer on His Experiences During September 11th Attacks; President Biden Criticizes Some Republican Governor for Policy Stances on COVID-19 Vaccines and Mask Mandates\b0\par\par\uc2 Laura Ingraham, Raymond Arroyo \par \uc2 7,264 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 September 2021\par \uc2 Fox News: The Ingraham Angle\par \uc2 INGANG\par \uc2 Englis